<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"hk-body"} -->
<p class="hk-body">Lina Haddad serves as course tutor, leading instruction on cleaning procedures, allergen management, and pest control. With a professional background in catering operations and food safety training, Lina specializes in practical station sanitation and the strict handling of the 14 major allergens. Her lessons explain two-stage cleaning, proper chemical dilution, and contact times, alongside clean-as-you-go systems that kitchen assistants can execute reliably. Lina also trains supervisors to spot subtle early signs of rodent or insect activity before pest issues escalate. She reviews learner allergen audits and ensures shift leads understand safe storage separation.</p>
