<p class="hk-body">Tomás Brandt is co-founder and cohort coordinator, overseeing learner support, onboarding, and practical kit fulfilment. If you have questions about cohort scheduling, digital access, or probe delivery, Tomás ensures you receive personal assistance. Support runs Monday through Friday from 9:00 to 17:00 CET, with all inquiries sent to hello@hakari-course.example answered within one working day. Tomás coordinates study resources, tracks practical log submissions, and assists team leads with company invoice arrangements. For immediate information, learners can also browse our FAQ, check the Dates and Fees schedule, or contact our support team directly.</p>
